# Local-first workflow

Before pushing to `main` (which triggers Vercel deploy):

1. Run `npm run build` and fix any errors.
2. For UI or flow changes, verify in `npm run dev` at http://localhost:3000 (or the port Next prints).
3. Hit `/api/health` locally when touching auth, Stripe, email, or DB.
4. Only `git push` after local verification passes, or when the user explicitly asks to deploy.

Batch related fixes into one commit/push when possible instead of pushing after every small change.

Do not push to production to "test" something that can be tested locally first.
